#### Research Interest
Curiosity, Metacognition, Question-asking, and Agency

#### About me
I’m interested in how children’s minds work, particularly when they experience curiosity and ask questions. Drawing on my experience as a pediatric occupational therapist, I’m also interested in how these processes may differ in children with developmental disabilities. Outside the lab, I enjoy spending time with dogs and cats, driving, visiting cafés, and singing.
